# UI/UX Standards

## Design System

- Primary color: purple (HSL 241.31 100% 64.12%)
- Border radius: 0.5rem base (--radius), with md and sm variants
- Font: system font stack (no custom fonts loaded)
- Spacing: follow Tailwind's spacing scale, prefer 4/6/8 for component padding

## Accessibility Requirements

- All interactive elements must be keyboard accessible
- Use Radix primitives (they handle ARIA, focus traps, keyboard nav)
- Color contrast: minimum 4.5:1 for text, 3:1 for large text
- Never rely solely on color to convey information
- All form inputs need associated labels (use Label from shadcn/ui)
- Loading states: use skeleton components or spinner with aria-busy

## Responsive Design

- Mobile-first approach (base styles for mobile, `sm:` and up for larger)
- Container max-width: 1400px with 2rem inline padding
- Touch targets: minimum 44x44px for mobile interactions
- Use Sheet/Drawer (vaul) for mobile overlays, Dialog for desktop

## Animation

- Use `tailwindcss-animate` utilities
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion` (the plugin handles this)
- Keep animations under 200ms for UI feedback, 300ms for transitions
- Accordion animations use Radix content height variables

## Component Guidelines

- Toast notifications via Sonner (`sonner` package)
- OTP input via `input-otp` package
- QR codes via `react-qr-code`
- Avatar generation via `react-jazzicon` (deterministic from address)
- Scroll areas use Radix ScrollArea for custom scrollbars
